# Everything under deploy/ is consumed by Linux on the Oracle ARM VM, never by
# Windows. A CRLF in a shell script fails as `bash: $'\r': command not found`,
# which is an obscure way to break a deploy, and systemd is only tolerant of
# CRLF by accident. This repo is developed on Windows with core.autocrlf=true,
# which stored CRLF directly in the blobs - pin LF so the cloner's local
# settings cannot reintroduce it.
deploy/**       text eol=lf
*.sh            text eol=lf
*.service       text eol=lf
*.timer         text eol=lf
Caddyfile       text eol=lf
